Unit Restriction: Cannot use [[Bebe (Uber Rare Cat)|Bebe]]

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 186.67 seconds<sup>5,600f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 186.67 seconds<sup>5,600f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 19.33 seconds<sup>580f</sup>, delay 6.67~23.33 seconds<sup>200f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*1 [[Dessert Witch - Obsession]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring a spammable attacker like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to take out the waves of Doges. Once they get through them, start deploying your ranged attackers (Units like Bahamut Cat and King Dragon Cat).

